---
import CoverageDemo from './CoverageDemo.astro'
---
<section id="coverage" class="wrap">
  <div class="split">
    <CoverageDemo />
    <div class="side">
      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Full coverage</p>
        <h2>The whole subject, or the check fails.</h2>
        <p class="lede">Before it writes a lesson, the agent lists every part of the subject in <code>syllabus.md</code>. The checker fails until each row names the lessons that teach it or says why it is skipped. Point it at the repo and it also fails on any top-level directory the syllabus leaves out.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="facts">
        <li><b>Every row is taught</b><span>Each Lessons cell lists real lesson ids, or reads <code>skip:</code> with a reason.</span></li>
        <li><b>Every card is complete</b><span>Answers, explanations and hints are checked, and every unit ends with a written answer.</span></li>
        <li><b>The page runs</b><span>The course script has to parse and load before anyone opens it.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 640px) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: clamp(40px, 6vw, 88px); align-items: center; }
  .section-head { margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .lede { font-size: 17px; }
  .facts { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 16px; }
  .facts li { display: grid; gap: 2px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .facts b { font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.015em; }
  .facts span { color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 15.5px; }
  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .split { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .side { order: -1; }
  }
</style>
